        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Florida Board of Regents, State University System of Florida, Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education, Florida Supreme Court\n- People: Judy Hample, Elwyn Thomas\n- Places: Florida, United States\n- Roles: Chancellor, Justice\n\nFacts:\n- The Florida Board of Regents governed the State University System of Florida from 1965 to 2001.\n- The State University System of Florida includes all public universities in Florida and consists of twelve public universities.\n- Elwyn Thomas was born on July 5, 1894, and died on February 15, 1971.\n- Elwyn Thomas was a Florida judge and served as a Justice of the Florida Supreme Court from 1938 to 1969.\n- Judy Hample is a former chancellor of the Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education.\n- Judy Hample is also a former chancellor of the Florida Board of Regents.",
